# the kit is LF text everywhere (Git for Windows checkouts included); binaries by extension
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
# the status-metrics goldens are the Python kit's outputs byte for byte (status-daily.csv is CRLF, as csv.writer writes it)
tests/status-metrics/* -text
# the SysML views toolkit's fixtures are converter inputs byte for byte (one is UTF-16; DOORS exports may be Windows-1252)
tools/sysml/views/tests/fixtures/** -text
